{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32160","headline":"堂堂曲 · 温庭筠","name":"堂堂曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钱唐岸上春如织，淼淼寒潮带睛色。\n淮南游客马连嘶，碧草迷人归不得。\n风飘客意如吹烟，纤指殷勤伤雁弦。\n一曲堂堂红烛筵，长鲸泻酒如飞泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}